        "created_at": "2013-11-21T02:45:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm up for anything. I feel like I'm not very good with hero selection, as I rarely do it. In particular, I don't think I've ever won against Iron Legacy, which is obviously one of the Difficulty 4 villains we need to keep in mind. Ideally we'll head into Round 4 with 6 heroes that work in different combinations, depending on who we face. But that's not very specific...</p>",
