        "created_at": "2013-11-21T02:55:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>According to the newly updated statistics, the (non-promo) heroes with the highest win% against Iron Legacy are (in descending order) Visionary, Tempest, Omnitron-X, Wraith, Nightmist, Chrono-Ranger, and then it trails off. The statistics probably aren't super accurate.</p>",
