        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-21T03:56:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I always go for a straight out burn vs. IL, so I like Nukers. &nbsp;Legacy is sick if you get next evolution and lead from the front in the first two turns, With Fanatic out I'd roll the Legacy/CR/Tempest/Tachyon team. &nbsp;lots of destruction, damage boosting and nuking.</p><p>We can also save the Wraith for that fight since Ambuscade is so weak non-advanced. &nbsp;Throat Jab/Hypersonic/Groundpound are legendary levels of awesome vs. IL.</p>",
