      {
        "id": 81996,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-21T09:43:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have:</p><p><span>AZ,&nbsp;Argent Adept,&nbsp;Crono Ranger,&nbsp;Expat,&nbsp;Haka,&nbsp;Legacy,&nbsp;Nightmist,&nbsp;Omnitron-X,&nbsp;Scholar,&nbsp;Tachyon,&nbsp;Tempest,&nbsp;Unity,&nbsp;Visionary,&nbsp;Wraith</span></p><p>Phantaskippy wants Expat and AZ, so say we leave CR, Legs, Nightmist, OX, Scholar, Tachyon, Tempest, Wraith for later rounds, then for our last two slots we can have:</p><p><span>Argent Adept, Haka, Unity,&nbsp;Visionary</span></p><p>Phanta suggested Adept, so let's go with that, and... Haka, since we're going against his nemesis? Or Unity could work too. I shall leave it to whoever sets up the game (I can't run the villain this time; Ambuscade is the only deck I don't have.)</p>",
