        "created_at": "2013-11-21T12:44:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd prefer Unity.</p><p>Adept Unity is wicked and Haka has Ground Pound and Mana which are huge vs. certain enemies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'll set the game up here in an hour or so, after I get the kids to school.</p><p>Team will be Expat/AZ/Unity/Adept</p>",
